    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113529" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειμά̆δ-ιον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>winter dwelling, winter
				quarters,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειμαδίῳ χρῆσθαι Λήμνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					4.32
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				11.13.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				5.18
			</span></i>: esp. in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειμάδια
			πήγνυσθαι</span> to fix one's <i>winter quarters,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sert.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Luc.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eum.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				98
			</span></i>.—Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειμάδιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, is cited
			in <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.62
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ χειμαδία</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥρα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				<u>Et.Gud.</u>
				563.53
			</span></i>.</div>
